          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "上周末带我女儿和狗一起去海边玩了，拍了这张照片。"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_url",
          "image_url": {
            "url": "https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i4/O1CN01Cdt3RHerFlE49oEn_!!6000000001872-0-tps-2048-1365.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "昨天给我的女儿过了生日，很开心，这是拍的照片，明年她再过生日的时候提醒我要准备礼物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_url",
          "image_url": {
            "url": "https://search-data-all.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/memory/borth.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这是我最喜欢的水果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_url",
          "image_url": {
            "url": "https://search-data-all.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/memory/fruit04.png"
          }
        }
